WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:07.082
It was a bright Saturday morning in downtown Metro City.

2
00:00:07.083 --> 00:00:14.440
Detective Smith was on his way to work.

3
00:00:14.441 --> 00:00:22.169
He had almost reached Police Headquarters when a dark shadow spilled over the plaza.

4
00:00:22.170 --> 00:00:24.463
Detective Smith looked up.

5
00:00:24.464 --> 00:00:27.381
"What is that?" he cried.

6
00:00:27.382 --> 00:00:34.953
A tall, silver robot sprayed a strange blue mist into the air.

7
00:00:34.954 --> 00:00:46.002
A blue bubble formed and slowly began to surround Police Headquarters.

8
00:00:46.003 --> 00:00:49.730
"Here comes a car!" Mara called to her friends.

9
00:00:49.731 --> 00:00:52.676
The car pulled into the parking lot.

10
00:00:52.677 --> 00:00:54.927
She waved to the car's driver.

11
00:00:54.928 --> 00:00:57.165
Then she pointed to a sign.

12
00:00:57.166 --> 00:01:00.600
The sign said Car Wash.

13
00:01:00.601 --> 00:01:02.685
"Hi," said the driver.

14
00:01:02.686 --> 00:01:05.145
"How much for a car wash?"

15
00:01:05.146 --> 00:01:07.703
"Ten dollars," said Mara.

16
00:01:07.704 --> 00:01:14.866
"Our soccer team is raising money for new uniforms."

17
00:01:14.867 --> 00:01:19.883
Terrell and Jack ran over with a bucket of soapy water.

18
00:01:19.884 --> 00:01:23.903
Roxy carried some big sponges.

19
00:01:23.904 --> 00:01:26.653
Everyone started scrubbing the car.

20
00:01:26.654 --> 00:01:32.014
"This is only the third car we've washed today," said Terrell, frowning.

21
00:01:32.015 --> 00:01:34.290
"I know," said Jack.

22
00:01:34.291 --> 00:01:36.529
"I hope more cars come.

23
00:01:36.530 --> 00:01:40.551
Otherwise we won't make enough money for new uniforms."

24
00:01:40.552 --> 00:01:45.151
"And our old ones are so ugly," said Mara.

25
00:01:45.152 --> 00:01:51.870
Roxy plunked her sponge into the water.

26
00:01:51.871 --> 00:01:55.767
She spread bubbles on the hood of the car.

27
00:01:55.768 --> 00:01:59.173
Soon the hood sparkled in the sunlight.

28
00:01:59.174 --> 00:02:01.613
Terrell looked thoughtful.

29
00:02:01.614 --> 00:02:06.771
"Maybe Rocket Girl can help us get new uniforms," he said.

30
00:02:06.772 --> 00:02:09.414
"We should ask her!" said Jack.

31
00:02:09.415 --> 00:02:12.535
"That's ridiculous," said Roxy.

32
00:02:12.536 --> 00:02:16.493
"Rocket Girl can't help us get new soccer uniforms."

33
00:02:16.494 --> 00:02:19.176
"Why not?" asked Terrell.

34
00:02:19.177 --> 00:02:22.658
"Because," said Roxy, thinking.

35
00:02:22.659 --> 00:02:25.208
"She doesn't know how to sew.

36
00:02:25.209 --> 00:02:29.607
Besides, Rocket Girl has more important things to do."

37
00:02:29.608 --> 00:02:33.076
Just then Roxy's watch beeped.

38
00:02:33.077 --> 00:02:39.730
"I'll be back in a second," she told her friends.

39
00:02:39.731 --> 00:02:46.198
Roxy walked to the other side of the parking lot.

40
00:02:46.199 --> 00:02:50.290
She pressed a button on her watch.

41
00:02:50.291 --> 00:02:53.384
"What's up, Mayor Bloom?" she asked.

42
00:02:53.385 --> 00:02:55.508
Mayor Bloom looked worried.

43
00:02:55.509 --> 00:02:58.947
"We have a big problem, Rocket Girl," he said.

44
00:02:58.948 --> 00:03:02.595
"I think somebody stole Police Headquarters."

45
00:03:02.596 --> 00:03:04.842
"What?" asked Roxy.

46
00:03:04.843 --> 00:03:07.722
She thought she had heard the mayor wrong.

47
00:03:07.723 --> 00:03:11.774
"You think somebody stole something from Police Headquarters?"

48
00:03:11.775 --> 00:03:14.679
"No!" cried Mayor Bloom.

49
00:03:14.680 --> 00:03:18.659
"I think somebody stole Police Headquarters!

50
00:03:18.660 --> 00:03:20.906
The whole building is gone!

51
00:03:20.907 --> 00:03:24.491
Wait a minute . . . Is . . . is that a robot?

52
00:03:24.492 --> 00:03:29.369
Oh no! Rocket Girl, I—"

53
00:03:29.370 --> 00:03:32.694
The screen faded as Roxy's watch clicked off.

54
00:03:32.695 --> 00:03:35.090
"Mayor Bloom?" Roxy said.

55
00:03:35.091 --> 00:03:37.338
"Mayor Bloom, are you there?"

56
00:03:37.339 --> 00:03:39.286
There was no answer.

57
00:03:39.287 --> 00:03:45.729
"Uh-oh!" Roxy gulped.

